# SHIP-v1 — the v1 feature set (2026-07-16)

**What this is:** the complete list of features Syxx must CONTAIN to be deployable, merged with the
20-feature ROI list below. Not a defect register — individual broken lines belong in `DELTAS.md`.
Each feature states what it must DO and where it stands.

**Deadline:** dedicated server free 3 months, cancel decision ~1 month out, deploy-ready **2 weeks**
(~2026-07-30).

**Legend:** ✅ shipped · 🟡 partial (exists, incomplete or one-platform) · ⬜ absent
**Grounded in** six tree audits, 2026-07-16, at `b7407bc`–`5708bab`. Status is verified against
code, never against a document.

**The merge:** the 20-feature list is a *capability* list — what Syxx can detect. It has no entry for
installing, buying, activating, updating, getting help, or being understood by a first-time user.
Those are features too, and they are what "deployable" means. Group A and Groups E–G below are the
additions; Groups B–D map onto the existing 20.

