12. Cache inspection *(existing)*

**Tier 3: Differentiators that justify the price**
13. Historical answer memory *(existing)*
14. DNS tunneling detection *(existing)*
15. **Home network baseline** *(new)* — profile home as known-good; compare every other network against it ("this café differs from home in 3 ways").
16. DNSSEC validation *(existing)*
17. **Lookalike domain alerts** *(new)* — punycode/homoglyph + newly-registered domains in the live query stream. Extends "is the answer honest" to "is the name itself deceptive."
