     dashboard). When set, every validate-key response is cryptographically verified
     before trusting `meta.valid`.
  2. Added `_verify_validate_key_response()` to `licensing.py`: reconstructs the signing
     data per the draft RFC http-signatures format `(request-target) | host | date |
     digest`, then verifies the Ed25519 signature using the `cryptography` library
